@startuml
title UCR-05 — Design Sequence: Convert Item to XP (7b)
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
actor Player
participant ":InventoryView" as View
participant ":ItemConversionService" as Service
participant ":Inventory" as Inv
participant ":CharacterState" as Char
Player -> View: requestConversion(itemId)
View -> Service: quote(itemId)
Service -> Inv: isEligibleForConversion(itemId)
Inv --> Service: eligible
alt [not eligible]
 Service --> View: conversion unavailable
 View --> Player: show rejection
else [eligible]
 Service --> View: ConversionQuote(xp)
 View --> Player: show XP gain; request confirmation
 alt [player cancels]
  Player -> View: cancel
  note over Inv,Char: No inventory or XP change
 else [player confirms]
  Player -> View: confirmConversion(itemId)
  View -> Service: convert(itemId)
  Service -> Inv: removeOne(itemId)
  Inv --> Service: removed
  alt [removed]
   Service -> Char: grantXP(amount)
   Service --> View: ConversionResult(success)
  else [not removed]
   Service --> View: ConversionResult(failed)
  end
  View --> Player: show conversion result
 end
end
note over Service,Char
Design invariant: removal and XP credit must be
atomic / idempotent; mechanism not yet specified.
end note
@enduml
